-- ============================================================================
-- DANGER: THIS FILE OVERWRITES THE LIVE LEAGUE.
--
-- It is a one-time seed snapshot, not a backup. Its final statement is
-- "on conflict (key) do update", so running it replaces whatever is in
-- kv_store today with the state frozen into this file -- every game, score,
-- roster move and playoff result recorded since the snapshot is discarded.
--
-- Running this on 2026-09-02 rolled Season 5 back to mid-Wild-Card and
-- destroyed the rest of the postseason. Do not run it against a live league.
--
-- To use it anyway (a brand new, empty project), delete the DO block below.
-- ============================================================================

do $$
begin
  raise exception 'Refusing to run: this file overwrites the live league. Read the header.';
end
$$;

on conflict (key) do update set value = excluded.value, updated_at = now();
